{"id":"n37147-1-2","stage":3,"title":"그토록 · 那么","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37147-1-2-1","ko":"너는 왜 별일 아닌 일에 그토록 화를 내니?","zh":"你为什么为这种小事这么生气呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"별일","meaning":"特别的事，大事","explanation":"별일：特别的事，大事。","readings":[{"term":"별일","audio":"/audio/74ed112211390f050e73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14481","senseId":"3","lemma":"별일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"별일","audio":"/audio/74ed112211390f050e73.mp3"}},{"text":"아닌","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아닌","audio":"/audio/abf14847af50c8c65e3b.mp3"}},{"text":"일에","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일에","audio":"/audio/2330199cec2ec7a0ebde.mp3"}},{"text":"그토록","meaning":"那么，如此","explanation":"그토록：那么，如此。","readings":[{"term":"그토록","audio":"/audio/a8137c3f266317cca612.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37147","senseId":"1","lemma":"그토록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":